{"id":463,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"幼小中高がつながる玉川学園のクラブ","feature_description":"玉川学園は、幼稚部から高校までの一貫教育を土台に、学年を越えたつながりの中でクラブ活動を育てる学校です。クラブ活動は、自分らしさを発揮しながら仲間と充実感を分かち合う場として位置づけられています。体育系から文化系まで幅広く、日々の学校生活の中で挑戦と協働を重ねやすいのが特徴です。活動を通して学園生活全体が立体的に広がります。","clubs":[{"id":9170,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9171,"name":"テニス（硬式）7～9年生","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9172,"name":"テニス（硬式）10～12年生","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9173,"name":"野球 6～9年生","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9174,"name":"野球 10～12年生","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9175,"name":"チアダンス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9176,"name":"柔道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9177,"name":"スキー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9178,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9179,"name":"バスケットボール女子 7～9年生","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9180,"name":"バスケットボール女子 10～12年生","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tamagawa.jp/academy/lower_upper_d/life/activities.html",